All suites in the resort have an exterior whirlpool on their terrace or balcony!
Offers complimentary bicycle tours to Nuevo Vallarta, a residential community only minutes away.
This is a family-friendly resort offering babysitting amenities, supervised kids and teens clubs, and is perfect for wedding parties made up of families they want to attend.
All outside events must end by 10pm.
